Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.67,0:00:03.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.67,0:00:05.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的一集马上就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.81,0:00:07.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了找齐四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.01,0:00:09.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了用这把铁碎牙打败奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:13.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落惊人的妖气朝着丑寅方向消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.55,0:00:15.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次出现了既非人类
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.55,0:00:17.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也非妖怪的一个亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.65,0:00:19.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在新的战斗马上要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.05,0:00:21.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 珊瑚 七宝跟云母
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.82,0:00:23.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿梭于时空 发生在战国时代与现代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:24.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.19,0:00:32.26,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分散在蓝蓝天空上的 七颗星星{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:36.79,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一颗星星 都刻着我的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:40.73,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算梦想被粉碎 我也要寻找爱{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:44.78,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:48.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧抓着我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:57.25,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些骗人的光阴 我再也不会输给它{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.36,0:01:02.52,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睁大眼睛 看清楚这瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:06.79,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它仍然紧紧围绕着我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.07,0:01:10.80,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人啜泣的 现实生活中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.87,0:01:14.81,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的…到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.58,0:01:18.51,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繁忙的这个世界{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.78,0:01:22.77,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永恒的碎片 忽隐又忽现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.05,0:01:26.82,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去触摸 去捕捉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.02,0:01:33.32,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:38.86,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了得到最后的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.03,0:01:45.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:42.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第102话 被亡魂袭击的妖狼族
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.30,0:02:48.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丑寅方向…应该是往这边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.91,0:02:56.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一股巨大不祥的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:02:59.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着丑寅方向飞走了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.51,0:03:01.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子这股妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.15,0:03:04.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,指的应该就是奈落没错 不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.92,0:03:06.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:09.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落这个坏蛋到底跑到哪里去了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:12.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会因为结界被犬夜叉给破了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.49,0:03:14.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以只好躲起来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:15.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落这么凶恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.03,0:03:17.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该不会就这样躲起来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.33,0:03:18.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.47,0:03:20.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道什么 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.34,0:03:22.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道奈落已经发现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:24.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们追踪到妖气在哪里消失
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.67,0:03:27.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以故意布下陷阱好引我们上钩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.01,0:03:29.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.31,0:03:32.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一路上碰的陷阱够多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.45,0:03:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照这么看来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.58,0:03:36.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是更接近奈落的巢穴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.72,0:03:38.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定又有陷阱等着我们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.46,0:03:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.19,0:03:45.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落到底又布下了什么样的陷阱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.27,0:03:57.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪全都逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.99,0:04:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然 是这股臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.59,0:04:16.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长老
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:18.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在山谷里的窝都被歼灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.66,0:04:20.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沼泽里的洞穴也被毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.06,0:04:24.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厉鬼接二连三吃了他们兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:27.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山上那些妖怪有一半都被吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.44,0:04:30.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利爪跟尖牙全都打不过他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要对抗这帮侵略者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.61,0:04:34.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看非得借助四魂之玉碎片才行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.58,0:04:40.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 那些坏蛋又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:43.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山对面那些家伙都被吃光了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:45.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在逐渐逼近我们的势力范围了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:47.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也有同伴被吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.89,0:04:49.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看除了找钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.19,0:04:50.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都不是他的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:51.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.09,0:04:53.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次菖蒲想尽办法去求他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:55.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道他坚持不肯回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:03.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厉鬼来了 快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:05.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会被吃掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.11,0:05:10.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 我们分头应付
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.55,0:05:19.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这帮妖怪为什么突然…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.29,0:05:21.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的食物被厉鬼抢走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.79,0:05:22.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都饿坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.29,0:05:23.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:25.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道被厉鬼吃掉之前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.79,0:05:27.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还得先喂饱这帮妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:31.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:39.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家快先过河再说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.08,0:05:46.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真没想到厉鬼这么快就下山来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.83,0:06:03.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说有一股强大妖气飞过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:05.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从附近打听到的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.33,0:06:06.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.77,0:06:08.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是听说又消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.17,0:06:09.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.67,0:06:11.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝哪边飞走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.61,0:06:12.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点大家好像也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:16.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺着这条河流一直走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.28,0:06:19.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上游就是北方的山
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:22.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于来到菖蒲跟长老爷爷家附近了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.05,0:06:24.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次菖蒲那个丫头说过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.35,0:06:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么厉鬼来 大家有危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.12,0:06:29.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拼了命想拉我跟她回去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.56,0:06:32.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果却被我给赶走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.36,0:06:36.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然有一种很不好的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:47.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有血
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.25,0:06:55.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长老
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:56.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:01.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.09,0:07:03.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只不过有点累了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.76,0:07:08.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 你振作一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.27,0:07:12.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些家伙已经追过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.73,0:07:16.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧 我来做饵引开那帮妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:18.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就趁这个机会快点逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.11,0:07:20.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一真追过来 老爷爷不就…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:24.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要保护长老尽快找到钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.75,0:07:25.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要他回来打败亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:28.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.25,0:07:31.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,区区几个杂碎小妖怪我还不放在眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:32.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.19,0:07:37.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爷爷 不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:39.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快回来呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:40.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:42.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.70,0:07:45.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身上还有伤的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:46.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走吧 菖蒲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:49.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再婆婆妈妈说这些了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:51.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要辜负老爷爷的一番心意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:09.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:13.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.03,0:08:18.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.67,0:08:20.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你们也是妖狼族
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.53,0:08:22.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爷爷 原来你会说话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.17,0:08:24.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你救了我一命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:26.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我恐怕不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:28.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.54,0:08:30.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是北方山上的长老吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.01,0:08:31.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:34.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菖蒲特别下山来找钢牙少主回去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:35.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:36.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙也来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:39.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.82,0:08:42.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到你真的是太好了 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:45.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次我们大家放弃了家园
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.93,0:08:47.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从北方山上逃到这来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:50.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些妖怪也是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.20,0:08:52.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃到这来…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.80,0:08:53.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在躲避什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.07,0:08:55.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.67,0:08:56.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:58.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个亡魂是从我们势力范围之外
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:09:01.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更北的地方来的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:05.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既不是妖怪 也不是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:10.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身上发出一股尸体和坟土的臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.95,0:09:12.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来这个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.85,0:09:16.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就开始吃…附近的妖怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.47,0:09:30.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下怎么办 钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.24,0:09:31.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:33.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会想去找那个亡魂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.37,0:09:36.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是正在找奈落吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.88,0:09:38.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这跟我们有什么关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才更要去查个清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.38,0:09:43.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么多兄弟被杀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.75,0:09:44.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能够坐视不理吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:46.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再加上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.72,0:09:48.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只臭笨狗也朝这边来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:49.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.12,0:09:51.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股狗骚味
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.39,0:09:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:55.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可受不了被他抢在前面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:56.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.63,0:09:58.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我 少主
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:04.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好大一股狼骚味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.14,0:10:05.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.41,0:10:08.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股特别自以为是的臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:10.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙那小子 八成刚刚走过这里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.78,0:10:12.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来 钢牙也跟我们一样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.15,0:10:15.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正朝着丑寅方向前进是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.92,0:10:17.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道他是不是掌握到其他线索呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.42,0:10:20.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们刚刚说了钢牙对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:21.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个声音是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.03,0:10:31.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:34.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是菖蒲耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.17,0:10:36.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菖蒲姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:37.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:39.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不就是那个把戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.91,0:10:41.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当成情敌的妖狼族姑娘吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.31,0:10:42.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.91,0:10:44.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.31,0:10:46.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是回北方山上去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.81,0:10:49.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是回去了 不过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.55,0:10:50.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:52.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有厉鬼追我们的族人所以又逃出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:53.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厉鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:55.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一只专门吃鬼的厉鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.82,0:10:59.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一只专门吃鬼的厉鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.20,0:11:08.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,师…师父
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.57,0:11:10.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果今天不能够翻过这座山
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.07,0:11:11.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就得在野外过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:13.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如折回村子里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.71,0:11:16.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求那些村民留我们过一夜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:18.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么这么胆小
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.85,0:11:19.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.82,0:11:22.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听人说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.85,0:11:26.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近这一带经常有厉鬼出来害人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:27.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是真的碰到厉鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.49,0:11:31.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候用我的法力打鬼给你看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:05.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然是鬼在吃鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:11.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,师父 你快收拾他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.50,0:12:16.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:19.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,师…师父
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.64,0:12:24.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:25.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.78,0:12:28.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那玩意既不是妖怪也不是人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:31.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个怪物是从东北方下来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:33.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,东北方？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.55,0:12:35.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不就是丑寅方向了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:36.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没多久的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:39.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住在山里的妖怪、精灵跟鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:40.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都被吃光了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.79,0:12:43.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近甚至逼近我们的势力范围
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:46.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一大批兄弟都被吃掉了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.57,0:12:50.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们妖狼族应该没有这么不堪一击吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.07,0:12:53.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就像一座小山那么大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:54.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然会有这种鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.68,0:12:58.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说自古以来有一些含恨而终的亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:12:59.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了替自己报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.71,0:13:02.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往往会化身成为厉鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.18,0:13:05.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是居然把妖怪全部都吃光
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.59,0:13:07.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是什么力量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.19,0:13:09.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才能够唤醒这种厉鬼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.96,0:13:11.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了他还会有谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.96,0:13:12.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:15.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须带着长老爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:18.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有仅存的妖狼族兄弟逃亡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.97,0:13:19.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:20.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.60,0:13:23.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果碰见钢牙我一定帮你转告他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.60,0:13:26.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族兄弟 四处逃窜的这件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你尽管放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.11,0:13:30.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.71,0:13:33.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己小心一点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:35.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多保重啊 菖蒲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:36.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:40.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个亡魂会发出尸体跟坟土的臭味喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.49,0:13:48.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凶骨大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.63,0:13:52.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拥有四魂之玉碎片的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:57.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:14:02.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子比他那些狼兄弟来得更是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:05.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么来着…琥珀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:07.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.75,0:14:09.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 虽然这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.38,0:14:14.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是先留下你背上那块四魂之玉碎片再走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.53,0:14:21.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,劝你不要随便乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.77,0:14:27.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你们也在一边虎视眈眈哪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.77,0:14:29.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:32.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正我也不想这么快就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:35.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,费了那么大力气好不容易才复活呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.29,0:14:55.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准你对我这班狼兄弟出手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:14:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.30,0:15:01.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身上也有四魂之玉碎片的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.87,0:15:04.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好庞大…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.07,0:15:09.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碎片我是要定了 还有你那条命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:12.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好大的一个怪物喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:15.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是那个什么亡魂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:18.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狼群的老爷爷说的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.32,0:15:20.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身上还真臭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.95,0:15:23.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你既不是人也不是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:25.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一股尸体跟坟土的臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.23,0:15:28.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我身上还有臭味啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:32.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从坟冢里出来已经好一段日子了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.33,0:15:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧 他没有否认
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:35.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道真的是亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:36.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子我得再多吃一点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.70,0:15:38.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,增加身上的血肉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.11,0:15:40.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你生得人高马大
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.24,0:15:43.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来成为我凶骨大爷的血肉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.75,0:15:48.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 你这只怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.09,0:15:56.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别想再吃我狼族兄弟的血肉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.63,0:16:00.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.59,0:16:02.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在脚上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:04.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你两只脚上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:06.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都带有四魂之玉碎片呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:09.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么凶骨是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.77,0:16:11.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是什么怪物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.64,0:16:15.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这怪物身上闻不到奈落的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.88,0:16:17.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可见他并不是奈落的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:18.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点可以确定
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.78,0:16:22.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是什么怪物？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:25.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用问也知道我是个人类啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.02,0:16:28.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 不是 绝对不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.02,0:16:31.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你只是人类的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.79,0:16:34.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能死后还从坟墓里复活吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.06,0:16:38.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都要归功于这个四魂之玉碎片呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.27,0:16:42.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是它让我的状况比活着的时候更好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:45.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片！居然是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.61,0:16:48.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 你从什么地方弄到这个东西的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.58,0:16:50.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.61,0:16:53.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不过是我嘴边的一块肉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.86,0:17:02.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭你这种慢吞吞的动作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:05.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为可以抓到我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:09.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动作快的家伙是在这呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.77,0:17:23.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想打哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:26.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你瞄准一点行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:30.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打不中吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.36,0:17:36.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.49,0:17:40.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个可恶的亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:42.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒要看看你还能够威风多久
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.34,0:17:55.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要每次都用同一招行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.89,0:18:10.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上给我滚回坟墓里去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.63,0:18:18.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇快看 那道光
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.93,0:18:20.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:23.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 为什么会发出这么强的光芒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:25.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道奈落跟钢牙碰上了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:28.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是这并不是奈落的气息啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:30.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:32.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是四魂之玉的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.81,0:18:33.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.38,0:18:35.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是…钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:43.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.89,0:18:47.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底想要打哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.86,0:18:49.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:18:58.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.74,0:18:59.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.41,0:19:04.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧 杂碎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.62,0:19:21.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真以为三两下就能把我摆平了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.93,0:19:28.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混帐家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.97,0:19:32.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 看前面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.68,0:19:38.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.95,0:19:47.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.95,0:19:50.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些四魂之玉碎片就送给我吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:52.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要做梦了 混帐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:19:57.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就不痛不痒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.43,0:20:00.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的目标本来就不是你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.71,0:20:09.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我的四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:25.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:26.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙少主 你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.33,0:20:28.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还活着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.77,0:20:34.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.27,0:20:39.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…奈落的毒虫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.27,0:20:44.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,控制凶骨的原来是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.22,0:20:50.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩一堆白骨了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.78,0:20:52.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是因为身体里被埋入四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.79,0:20:53.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才能复活
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.19,0:20:56.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.76,0:20:58.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你帮兄弟们报了仇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.23,0:21:01.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些不幸遇难的兄弟 这下可以瞑目了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.36,0:21:05.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的邪气 朝着丑寅方向去了…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:08.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 戈薇是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.37,0:21:09.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.30,0:21:12.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.31,0:21:14.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己小心一点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.28,0:21:18.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇也跟我说过同样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.08,0:21:26.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟戈薇一样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:31.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说凶骨已经死啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.62,0:21:33.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 蛇骨大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.53,0:21:36.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 那个没用的笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:38.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 这也是没办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:42.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙本来就是我们之中最差劲的一个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.34,0:21:45.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 怎么样呢 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.31,0:21:46.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.57,0:21:51.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊 这次我的对手犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.81,0:21:54.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是不是个帅哥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.35,0:21:57.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点恐怕要请您自己去判断
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.35,0:22:02.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真想早点会会你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.76,0:22:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.66,0:22:15.07,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红红的太阳照亮一切{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.60,0:22:24.91,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也照遍过去和现在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.11,0:22:34.28,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些夕阳下的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.56,0:22:44.09,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这颗心真的能承担吗{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:49.06,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我什么办法才能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.37,0:22:53.83,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过得比以前更开朗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.14,0:23:01.38,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做就算会让自己委屈{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.38,0:23:07.61,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}默默承受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.92,0:23:12.15,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.66,0:23:19.59,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌仍会不断在我心中回荡{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.10,0:23:29.30,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌才是我的路标{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.93,0:23:52.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一群手段凶残 最后死于非命的佣兵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.60,0:23:54.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来到七人帮坟冢附近后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.40,0:23:57.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们眼前突然出现了一个耍弯刀的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.91,0:23:58.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.64,0:24:00.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是七人帮屠杀队长
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.44,0:24:02.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛇骨大爷的蛇骨刀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.91,0:24:04.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明往下劈了却还会来回旋绕的那把刀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.95,0:24:05.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直就像是蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.95,0:24:06.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.88,0:24:08.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底刀从哪边飞出来的都看不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.65,0:24:10.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.92,0:24:12.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七人帮重返人间
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.96,0:24:13.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.96,0:24:16.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那对可爱的耳朵 送给我嘛
